{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107360","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107360","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1210736001:1":{"text":"언니, 드디어 왔네? 오래 기다렸다고!","source_cn":"姐姐，你终于来了？我等你好久了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B49E0C233E40F9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210736002:0":{"text":"...! \n이미 우리를 발견했던 거야?","source_cn":"……！\\n你早就发现我们了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5887662BDC580A34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210736003:0":{"text":"당연하지, 내가 보니만 발견했을 바보 같아?! 천진난만하기는. 하하하!","source_cn":"不然呢，你以为我只发现了波妮那个蠢货吗？！天真哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4726E712803B03DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1210736003":{"text":"당연하지, 내가 보니만 발견했을 바보 같아?! 천진난만하기는. 하하하!","source_cn":"不然呢，你以为我只发现了波妮那个蠢货吗？！天真哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4726E712803B03DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210736004:0":{"text":"야, 넌 뭐야? 언니랑 이야기하고 있는데, 닥쳐!","source_cn":"喂，你是什么东西？我和姐姐在聊天的时候，给我闭上嘴！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x514B52FD9CC9D6B7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"야, 넌 뭐야? 언니랑 이야기하고 있는데, 닥쳐!","female":"야, 넌 뭐야? 언니랑 이야기하고 있는데, 닥쳐!","variant_male_record_index":"129876","variant_female_record_index":"129877","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210736005:0":{"text":"언니, 애타게 찾던 테시오는 잘 만났지? 어때? 재밌었어?","source_cn":"姐姐，你不是想要泰西欧吗？我送给你啦，怎么样，玩得开心吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE84E5466B78AB2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210736006:0":{"text":"표정을 보니, 썩 좋지는 않았나 보네... 어떡하지? 난... 너무 흥분되는데?!","source_cn":"瞧你的表情，好像不是很开心呢……怎么办？我可……开心地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6918418D1D859D4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210736007:0":{"text":"나라...","source_cn":"奈拉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6955F4AFE1F2D403","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210736008:0":{"text":"그 가증스러운 동정심은 넣어둬, 나를 죽은 사람 취급하지 말라고!! 내 몸은 비록 이 지경이지만 귀는 아직 쓸 만해.","source_cn":"收起你可笑的怜悯，别把我当个死人！！虽然我的身体的确破...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB47B6C5B9C34E490","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210736009:0":{"text":"지금 언니의... 힘껏 수축되는... 심장 소리, 그리고 목에 보이는 파란 핏줄 속에서... 펌프질하는... 피 흐르는 소리가 선명히 들린다고!","source_cn":"比如现在，我就听到了你胸膛……用力收缩的……心脏，还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAD9C2611246AA88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210736010:0":{"text":"오, 설마? 언니, 지금 긴장한 거야? 심장 소리 장난 아닌데? 그리고... 두려움도 있네?","source_cn":"噢，不是吧？亲爱的姐姐，你的心跳告诉我，你很紧张？还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AF6BC2A36D90661","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210736011:0":{"text":"뭐가 두려운 거야? 내가? 아니면 내 갈고리? 그것도 아니면... 내가 언니를 나와 같은 존재로 만들까 봐?","source_cn":"你在怕什么？怕我？怕我的钩锁，还是……怕我把你也变成我这样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE607D796197607C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210736012:0":{"text":"... 그만해!","source_cn":"……够了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC3EBBD5441C104","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210736013:0":{"text":"하하하하하! 알겠다. 나의 증오심이... 무서운 거지?","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈哈！我知道了，你怕……我的恨？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD95AEF2C51D77D71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210736014:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210736015:0":{"text":"하하하... 하하하... 하하! 너무 웃긴다 하하하...","source_cn":"哈哈哈……哈哈哈哈哈……哈哈！太好笑了哈哈哈哈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48D5B2E9A5FCF109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210736016:0":{"text":"웃기 싫으면 억지로 웃지 마.","source_cn":"如果不想笑，就别笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66673EC03AEA75EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1210736017:0":{"text":"옛날이야기는 하고 싶지 않다면, 내 갈고리와 인사나 하라고. 언니를 기다리고 있었으니...","source_cn":"……既然你不想和我叙旧，那就来和我的钩锁打招呼吧，它可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C66D758E48E3F8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210736018:0":{"text":"언니의 머리, 심장, 사지, 모두 자르고 싶었대!!","source_cn":"——你的头，你的心脏，四肢，它全都想割下来呢！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28DE75D1A8A06E0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"기다리고 있었던 거야?","source_cn":"你在守株待兔？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9FBF5AA8739735D2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"기다리고 있었던 거야?","female":"기다리고 있었던 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"65440","variant_female_record_index":"65441","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_